<title>USA: Ag-Bag completes sale of two systems.</title>
<headline>Ag-Bag completes sale of two systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>WARRENTON, Ore., Jan 2 (Reuter) Ag-Bag International Ltd said on Thursday it completed the sale of two composting systems for a total of about $185,000.</p>
<p>The first system was sold to Norcal Inc, a California-based operator of a site at B&amp;J Landfill in Vacaville. The second system was sold to the Oakland Zoo in Oakland, Calif.</p>
